#: ParameterPanel.cpp:393
msgid ""
"Sets the palette quantizer, the refinement passes and the lookahead below in "
"one go.\n"
"Fast: one refinement pass. About the same quality as Standard, in roughly a "
"quarter less time.\n"
"Standard: the default.\n"
"Best quality: 8 passes and a lookahead of 4 pixels. About 5 percent less "
"error on typical photographs, but it takes roughly 7 times as long.\n"
"Changing one of those three settings by hand switches this to Custom. Greyed "
"out while the palette is locked, as the quantizer and the passes have no "
"effect then."
msgstr ""

